# The delivered art folder, kept on disk and out of the repository.
#
# `Mr Fraction Word Express Art/` is the original drop. Every one of its ten
# files was copied into `assets/art/` — verified name-for-name and byte-length
# for byte-length — and `assets/art/` is the only one anything references.
# Publishing both would put 3.2 MB of exact duplicates on Pages, in a folder
# whose name contains spaces (so every URL to it carries %20).
#
# Ignored rather than deleted, deliberately: this project has no version
# control history to recover from, so the original drop stays where it is.
Mr Fraction Word Express Art/

# OS and editor noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
